i-039-jin:p003","quote":"唐叔子燮，是爲晉侯。晉侯子寧族，是爲武侯。武侯之子服人，是爲成侯。成侯子福，是爲厲侯。厲侯之子宜臼，是爲靖侯。靖侯已來，年紀可推。自唐叔至靖侯五世，無其年數。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p004","quote":"靖侯十七年，周厲王迷惑暴虐，國人作亂，厲王出奔于彘，大臣行政，故曰「共和」。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p005","quote":"十八年，靖侯卒，子釐侯司徒立。釐侯十四年，周宣王初立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p011","quote":"昭侯元年，封文侯弟成師于曲沃。曲沃邑大於翼。翼，晉君都邑也。成師封曲沃，號爲桓叔。靖侯庶孫欒賓相桓叔。桓叔是時年五十八矣，好德，晉國之衆皆附焉。君子曰：「晉之亂其在曲沃矣。末大於本而得民心，不亂何待！」"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p003","text":"唐叔子燮，是爲晉侯。晉侯子寧族，是爲武侯。武侯之子服人，是爲成侯。成侯子福，是爲厲侯。厲侯之子宜臼，是爲靖侯。靖侯已來，年紀可推。自唐叔至靖侯五世，無其年數。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"唐叔","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"燮","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"寧族","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"服人","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin